# DUSKLING X5, CINDER POCKET (room 41): the cinder pocket, a warp pocket that skips the lava steps.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 41
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 27
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 21
wait 2
expect room == 26
